+# Copyright 2026-present the Unsloth AI Inc. team. All rights reserved. See /studio/LICENSE.AGPL-3.0
+#
+# Vendored from ROCm/aiter (https://github.com/ROCm/aiter), commit 6aa39366b7d368d415231643bc10fa0e9114cc32,
